ts club meets on Friday. Tom can play basketball. He cannot play tennis. His sister can play tennis. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Tom can play tennis."},{"key":"B","text":"The club meets on Monday."},{"key":"C","text":"Tom can play basketball."},{"key":"D","text":"His sister cannot play tennis."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"Tom can play basketball，他不会网球。","verify":"\"Tom can play basketball.\""},{"id":"cne_j044_q1","topicId":"cne_j044","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「吉他」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"chess"},{"key":"B","text":"guitar"},{"key":"C","text":"club"},{"key":"D","text":"dance"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"guitar 的意思是吉他。","verify":"\"guitar\""},{"id":"cne_j044_q2","topicId":"cne_j044","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"「chess」的中文意思是哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"吉他"},{"key":"B","text":"俱乐部"},{"key":"C","text":"国际象棋"},{"key":"D","text":"跳舞"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"chess 的意思是国际象棋。","verify":"\"国际象棋\""},{"id":"cne_j044_q3","topicId":"cne_j044","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"选择表示「俱乐部」的单词。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"guitar"},{"key":"B","text":"chess"},{"key":"C","text":"dance"},{"key":"D","text":"club"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"表示俱乐部的单词是 club。","verify":"\"club\""},{"id":"cne_j044_q4","topicId":"cne_j044","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「跳舞」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"dance"},{"key":"B","text":"guitar"},{"key":"C","text":"chess"},{"key":"D","text":"club"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"dance 的意思是跳舞。","verify":"\"dance\""},{"id":"cne_j045_q1","topicId":"cne_j045","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"我会弹吉他。哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I can to play the guitar."},{"key":"B","text":"I can plays the guitar."},{"key":"C","text":"I can play the guitar."},{"key":"D","text":"I can play guitar the."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"can 后面用动词原形；乐器前通常加 the。","verify":"\"I can play the guitar.\""},{"id":"cne_j045_q2","topicId":"cne_j045","dif