"},{"key":"C","text":"No, I am not."},{"key":"D","text":"No, I can."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"can 的否定简答是 No, I can't。","verify":"\"No, I can't.\""},{"id":"cne_j046_q4","topicId":"cne_j046","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"What club do you want to join? 这句在问什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"你会不会游泳"},{"key":"B","text":"俱乐部在哪里"},{"key":"C","text":"你想加入哪个俱乐部"},{"key":"D","text":"吉他多少钱"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"what club 问哪一个俱乐部。","verify":"\"你想加入哪个俱乐部\""},{"id":"cne_j047_q1","topicId":"cne_j047","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Music Club. Can you sing or dance? Come and join us. Call Mr. Brown. 这个俱乐部需要什么才能？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"唱歌或跳舞"},{"key":"B","text":"下棋"},{"key":"C","text":"踢足球"},{"key":"D","text":"画画"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"sing or dance 是唱歌或跳舞。","verify":"\"唱歌或跳舞\""},{"id":"cne_j047_q2","topicId":"cne_j047","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Music Club. Can you sing or dance? Come and join us. Call Mr. Brown. 要联系谁？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Mr. Green"},{"key":"B","text":"Mr. Brown"},{"key":"C","text":"Gina"},{"key":"D","text":"Tom"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"Call Mr. Brown。","verify":"\"Mr. Brown\""},{"id":"cne_j047_q3","topicId":"cne_j047","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"We need students for the chess club. Can you play chess? 他们需要会什么的学生？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"会弹吉他"},{"key":"B","text":"会游泳"},{"key":"C","text":"会下国际象棋"},{"key":"D","text":"会说英语"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"play chess 是下棋。","verify":"\"会下国际象棋\""},{"id":"cne_j047_q4","topicId":"cne_j047","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"We need students for the chess club. Can you play chess? 哪一句和广告一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"The club wants singers."},{"key":"B","text":"Students must play the guitar."},{"key":"C","text":"The club is only for teachers."},{"key":"D","text":"The club wants students who can play chess."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"广告要会下棋的学生。","verify":"\"The club wants students who can play chess.\""},{"id":"cne_j107_q1","topicId":"cne_j107","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"sit down 里，哪一个音常常不完全发出来？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"sit 里的 t"},{"key":"B","text":"down 里的 n"},{"key":"C","text":"sit 里的 s"},{"key":"D","text":"down 里的 d"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"t 后面紧接爆破音 d，t 通常不完全爆破。","verify":"\"sit 里的 t\""},{"id":"cne_j107_q2","topicId":"cne_j107","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一个短语有不完全爆破？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"my apple"},{"key":"B","text":"good time"},{"key":"C","text":"to a park"},{"key":"D","text":"an old man"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"good 的 d 和 time 的 t 都是爆破音，相邻时前一个不完全爆破。","verify":"\"good time\""},{"id":"cne_j107_q3","topicId":"cne_j107","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"big kite 里，不完全爆破发生在哪里？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"b 和 i 之间"},{"key":"B","text":"k 和 i 之间"},{"key":"C","text":"g 和 k 之间"},{"key":"D","text":"词尾 e 后面"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"big 的 g 和 kite 的 k 是相邻爆破音。","verify":"\"g 和 k 之间\""},{"id":"cne_j107_q4","topicId":"cne_j107","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"不完全爆破通常出现在什么时候？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"元音后面是句号"},{"key":"B","text":"单词只有一个音节"},{"key":"C","text":"句末用升调"},{"key":"D","text":"两个爆破音挨在一起"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"前一个爆破音受后一个爆破音影响，常常听不全。","verify":"\"两个爆破音挨在一起\""}]
